This product includes ideas and structural conventions inspired by
"marketingskills" by Corey Haines and contributors
(https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills), distributed under
the MIT License.

No verbatim files from marketingskills are included. The skills under
`.claude/skills/` and the runtime modules under `src/marketing/` are
mpaios-specific variations written for a conversational WhatsApp
runtime (openclaw). Where upstream skill names survive (e.g.
`customer-research`, `churn-prevention`, `copywriting`, `copy-editing`,
`marketing-psychology`, `launch-strategy`, `referral-program`,
`analytics-tracking`, `ab-test-setup`, `product-marketing-context`),
the content has been rewritten against mpaios positioning, audience,
and runtime surface.

